/* ——— 空目录占位（沙盒路径语义解释）——— */
"This directory is empty" = "此目录为空";
"No files or subdirectories were found at this path." = "该路径下没有找到任何文件或子目录。";
"Tip: use the Search tab with a keyword (e.g. the app's bundle ID) to find files the directory view might miss." = "提示：在搜索标签页中按关键词（例如应用 Bundle ID）搜索可以找到目录视图可能遗漏的文件。";

"Documents folder" = "Documents 文件夹";
"Apps store user-generated files here (iCloud on iOS shares this). Empty = the app has not saved any user documents yet. Backups typically include this folder." = "应用在此存放用户生成的文件（iOS 上 iCloud 也会同步此目录）。为空 = 该应用尚未保存任何用户文档。备份通常会包含此文件夹。";

"Library folder" = "Library 文件夹";
"The app's 'system' data root. Contains Preferences, Caches, Cookies, Application Support, etc. Subdirectories are created lazily — seeing Library with only a few children is normal on freshly-installed apps." = "应用的「系统级」数据根目录，包含 Preferences、Caches、Cookies、Application Support 等。子目录是懒惰创建的——刚安装的应用里 Library 只有很少几项是正常现象。";

"Preferences — UserDefaults plists" = "Preferences（UserDefaults plist）";
"Each time the app calls `UserDefaults.synchronize` (or the periodic autosave runs), a plist named <bundleID>.plist is written here. Empty = the app has not persisted any defaults yet — e.g. it's a fresh install and no settings screen was opened. MobileGestalt writes go to a different path (system group, not this folder)." = "应用每次调用 `UserDefaults.synchronize`（或系统周期自动保存）时，会在此写入一份名为 <bundleID>.plist 的 plist。为空 = 该应用尚未保存任何偏好设置，例如刚安装完还没打开设置页。MobileGestalt 写入不在此目录（在系统组，另有路径）。";

"Library / Caches" = "Library / Caches";
"Network responses, image thumbnails, rebuildable data go here. The OS can purge this folder when disk is low (apps must recreate contents). Empty = no cached data written yet, or the OS purged it." = "网络响应、图片缩略图、可重建数据存放在这里。磁盘空间不足时系统可能自动清理此目录（应用必须可重建内容）。为空 = 尚未写入缓存数据，或已被系统清理。";

"tmp / scratch directory" = "tmp（临时目录）";
"Short-lived temporary files. iOS can delete contents here when the app is not running. Empty means nothing is currently being extracted, downloaded or decoded." = "短期临时文件。应用未运行时 iOS 可能删除此处内容。为空 = 当前没有正在解压、下载或解码的文件。";

"Library / Application Support" = "Library / Application Support";
"Non-user-facing runtime files: databases, downloaded assets, in-app purchases receipt cache. Empty = the app uses a different persistence location or nothing persists yet. Files here are backed up unless marked with .nosync." = "非用户可见的运行时文件：数据库、下载资源、应用内购买收据缓存等。为空 = 应用使用了其他持久化位置，或尚未写入任何内容。此处文件默认参与备份，除非标记 .nosync。";

"Library / Cookies" = "Library / Cookies";
"HTTPCookieStorage persistently saved cookies (binary plist). Empty = the app has not made any cookie-setting network requests yet, or uses a non-persistent cookie session." = "HTTPCookieStorage 持久化保存的 Cookie（二进制 plist）。为空 = 应用尚未发起过设置 Cookie 的网络请求，或使用了非持久化的 Cookie 会话。";

"Saved Application State" = "已保存的应用状态";
"UIKit state restoration data. Written when the app is backgrounded. Empty on apps that opt out of state restoration, or immediately after a force-quit." = "UIKit 状态恢复数据，应用进入后台时写入。对已退出状态恢复的应用为空，或在强退之后为空。";

"App container root" = "应用容器根目录";
"Top-level container for a single app's sandbox. Files you see here are the ones created by the app: Documents, Library, tmp. Empty subdirectories mean the app hasn't exercised that code path yet." = "单个应用沙盒的顶层容器，这里的文件就是应用实际创建的 Documents、Library、tmp 等。子目录为空意味着对应代码路径尚未被应用运行过。";

